@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowFontSize 16
skinparam maxMessageSize 185
hide footbox
autonumber
title Sequence view · A scheduled relay publishes committed edit intent\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/handlers.py#L70
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/delivery/sql.py#L58
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/scripts/aws/v1/definitions.py#L1766
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowFontSize 16
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
participant "handlers\n«Media module»" as H $MEDIA
participant "messaging\n«Media module»" as M $MEDIA
participant "delivery.sql\n«module»" as D $INFRA
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
participant "t: SQS" as T $INFRA
activate H
H -> M : publish_commands(f,t,limit=25,deadline=deadline)
activate M
M -> D : publish_due(f,MediaOutbox,t,\nlimit=25,deadline=deadline)
activate D
 group SQL reservation
  D -> DB : SQL: due row FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;\nclaim_token; tries++; next_try_at; COMMIT
 end
 D -> T : send(queue,body)
 activate T
 T --> D : SDK response (or exception)
 deactivate T
 group SQL acknowledgement
  D -> DB : SQL: lock row; match claim_token;\nclear token; reschedule; sent_at only on success; COMMIT
 end
D --> M : published count
deactivate D
M --> H : published count
deactivate M
deactivate H
legend bottom
EventBridge invokes handlers separately; one due-row pass shown, repeated to limit/deadline.
SQS send is awaited outside SQL locks; token mismatch skips ACK; uncertain sends can replay.
endlegend

@enduml
